  <para style="io2">Finqila Gosoota Kaabaa<char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 12:1-14:20">12:1—14:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io2">Mootota Yihuda'aatii fi Israa'elii<char style="ior"><ref loc="1KI 14:21-16:34">14:21—16:34</ref></char></para>
